    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298780/extras/7c125c82d398b4a254c29e69c3c18f45.poster.avif?t=1749495234\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298780/extras/7c125c82d398b4a254c29e69c3c18f45.webm?t=1749495234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298780/extras/7c125c82d398b4a254c29e69c3c18f45.mp4?t=1749495234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raise, multiply, and battle with dice \u2014 a dice deck-building roguelike!</strong><br><br>Utilize a unique system where all dice on the field roll simultaneously and their outcomes collide to shape the fight.  <br>In both battles and events, everything is up to the roll. Embark on a journey where luck meets strategy!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Simultaneous Roll System</strong><br>Choose whether to convert hand dice into mana or play them onto the field. All dice\u2014including ally, enemy, and weather dice\u2014are rolled at once and calculated together. Their combined results determine the flow of battle.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298780/extras/9377d8122083daefc11c279682e6c957.poster.avif?t=1749495234\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298780/extras/9377d8122083daefc11c279682e6c957.webm?t=1749495234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298780/extras/9377d8122083daefc11c279682e6c957.mp4?t=1749495234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Dice Customization</strong><br>Dice can receive temporary boosts in combat through the effects of relics and skills. Outside of combat, you can permanently enhance them through events such as duplication and fusion, or by applying special enchantments.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298780/extras/545f009e721e364f06d92c4376dc3e8c.poster.avif?t=1749495234\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298780/extras/545f009e721e364f06d92c4376dc3e8c.webm?t=1749495234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298780/extras/545f009e721e364f06d92c4376dc3e8c.mp4?t=1749495234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Strategic Variety</strong><br>The combination of characters, dice, enchantments, relics, skills, and enemies\u2014along with your choices\u2014will lead your adventure down unexpected paths.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298780/extras/7c125c82d398b4a254c29e69c3c18f45.poster.avif?t=1749495234\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298780/extras/7c125c82d398b4a254c29e69c3c18f45.webm?t=1749495234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298780/extras/7c125c82d398b4a254c29e69c3c18f45.mp4?t=1749495234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raise, multiply, and battle with dice \u2014 a dice deck-building roguelike!</strong><br><br>Utilize a unique system where all dice on the field roll simultaneously and their outcomes collide to shape the fight.  <br>In both battles and events, everything is up to the roll. Embark on a journey where luck meets strategy!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Simultaneous Roll System</strong><br>Choose whether to convert hand dice into mana or play them onto the field. All dice\u2014including ally, enemy, and weather dice\u2014are rolled at once and calculated together. Their combined results determine the flow of battle.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298780/extras/9377d8122083daefc11c279682e6c957.poster.avif?t=1749495234\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298780/extras/9377d8122083daefc11c279682e6c957.webm?t=1749495234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298780/extras/9377d8122083daefc11c279682e6c957.mp4?t=1749495234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Dice Customization</strong><br>Dice can receive temporary boosts in combat through the effects of relics and skills. Outside of combat, you can permanently enhance them through events such as duplication and fusion, or by applying special enchantments.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298780/extras/545f009e721e364f06d92c4376dc3e8c.poster.avif?t=1749495234\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298780/extras/545f009e721e364f06d92c4376dc3e8c.webm?t=1749495234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298780/extras/545f009e721e364f06d92c4376dc3e8c.mp4?t=1749495234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25c6 Strategic Variety</strong><br>The combination of characters, dice, enchantments, relics, skills, and enemies\u2014along with your choices\u2014will lead your adventure down unexpected paths.</p>",
